      "{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"What to Expect at Trading Expo India 2027\",\"description\":\"Two days, 70–80 exhibitors, 80+ speakers, live demos and a lucky draw — your complete walkthrough of Trading Expo India 2027 on 23–24 April.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-09-25\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Trading Expo India\"}}",
